window.products.push({"id":109243,"name":"Kiopi Reusable Stainless Steel Coffee Capsules Compatible with Nespresso Vertuoline GCA1 and Delonghi ENV135-7.77 oz (230ml) Refillable Vertuo Pods - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818fFT2MMhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PRODUCT INFORMATION Materials: Stainless Steel (capsule and tamp/scoop) and Plastic (Brush) Brew: 7.7oz (230ml) cup of coffee PACKAGE INCLUDES 1 capsule 1 scoop/tamp 1 brush COMPATIBILITY Compatible with Nespresso Vertuoline GCA1  Compatible with Nespresso Vertuoline Plus,  Compatible with Delonghi ENV 135 Compatible with Delonghi ENV 150 IMPORTANT TIPS Beans: works best with medium and dark roast beans.  Grind Size: I recommend using fine to medium fine coffee grounds and not using grounds that are too coarse or too fine. If you use coarse grounds, the coffee will come out weak; and alternatively, if you use extremely fine grounds, it can cause the water to get blocked (which may result in machine complications). The ideal grind size is 140-160 microns.  Ground Quantity: Fill the capsule just (barely) to the top - less is more. Try to avoid packing the capsule too full because it may cause the water to flow through slowly and will not produce the best results.  Tamp Pressure: as a general rule, tamp the coffee down lightly. If using finer grounds, apply less pressure; if using coarser grounds, apply a bit more pressure.  GUARANTEE  No worries! If this product doesn't work out for you, you're covered by our 100% money back guarantee - no questions asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818fFT2MMhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09MVLFB8G","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-109243","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MVLFB8G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MVLFB8G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
