window.products.push({"id":109391,"name":"Upgraded DC97-05280W Washer Suspension Rods Kit by Sikawai - Fit for Sam-sung WA45H7000AW Replaces DC97-16350E DC97-16350C DC97-16350D DC97-05280X DC9","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f7JSNgW8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【When Do I Need to Replace It ?】- 4 x DC97-05280W Suspension Rod Kit, approximately 26.4 inches in length. Supports the washer tub and keeps it stable during unbalanced loads, allows the washer tub to move while helping minimize vibration in the spin mode. If your washer unbalances, displays dc error code, or even fails to complete light load, vibrates, or shakes, you can replace all 4 suspension rods at the same time to keep the washer slot stable. ✅【Widely Adaptable】- DC97-05280W washer suspension rods compatible with Sam-sung Samsung WA45H7000AW/A2 WA50R5400AV/US WA50R5200AW/US WA54R7600AC WA50R5400AW/US WA422PRHDWR/AA WA5451ANW/XAA WA45N3050AW WA19J3000AW WA400PJHDWR WA40J3000AW WA422PRHDWR WA476DSHASU WA476DSHAWR WA484DSHASU WA484DSHAWR WA45N3050AW WA45T3200AW etc. ✅【LIFETIME WARRANTY】- If you have any problems or there is any damage to the product, we will offer a 100% money-back guarantee. Welcome to contact us, we will try our best to solve your problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【Easy Installation 】- 1.Unplug the washer before installing this part.Wear work gloves to protect your hands.2.Be very careful of the grease used on the pivot points. It is very difficult to remove.3.The replacement process takes about 20 ~ 30 minutes. It can be installed quickly and easily by maintenance personnel or yourself with appropriate tools and safety precautions. Saving your time and money. ✅【Fix Most Symptoms】- ➤If your washer was out of balance, ➤getting DC error, ➤wouldn't even complete a very light load,➤or vibrate or shake .You made to replace all 4 suspension rod at the same time to keep the washer tub stable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f7JSNgW8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sikawai","source_asin":"B08C4QWSSC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-109391","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C4QWSSC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C4QWSSC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
