window.products.push({"id":109470,"name":"The Coffee Seal Aluminum Foils Lids to Reuse Vertuoline Capsules Coffee Pods Compatible with Nespresso VertuoLine Machine 63mm (200/package) (200)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RMc70C+9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lead a cost-saving and eco-friendly lifestyle. Hi! I’m Joe from the Coffee Seal. Why did I decide to create the perfect sized foil seals for the Nesspreso Vertouline pods? Well, I was so pained by the waste of money and pollution that I was causing by buying new Nespresso Vertuoline pods and watching the old pods being tossed away. Yet, I really enjoyed the cup of coffee that the Vertuoline machine would make for me every morning... I knew I had to make a difference, and thank goodness, with a bit of research and experimentation, now there is a solution through the Coffee Seal. The Nespresso Vertuoline Pods are made well and they have the necessary bar code on them. So I experimented with different ways of reusing the pod. First I tried different foil covers but found that they wouldn’t fit right. They were either too big and would cover the barcode or too small, which made it challenging to get on and I found they would not stay on well. Finally, after many cups of coffee, I came up with the foil that I felt gave the best results for that perfect cup of coffee. This is how you too can enjoy the perfect eco-friendly cup of coffee: TIPS: 1) Using store-bought already ground coffee will give you more crema. 2) If you grind the coffee at home make sure it is ground very fine to enjoy the maximum flavor and more crema. 3) Fill the capsule all the way and tap the coffee before sealing to make sure it is fully filled. Reusing your Nespresso capsule with THE COFFEE SEAL foil seals will also give you the freedom to brew your favorite coffee brand and roast. You will now be able to brew all your favorite drinks, coffee, tea, or hot chocolate, in the most cost-efficient and Eco-friendly way!!! It is no doubt... The more you use it the faster you’ll become a pro at figuring amounts that work for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RMc70C+9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Coffee Seal","source_asin":"B08BG5B6PT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-109470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BG5B6PT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BG5B6PT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":109471,"name":"DC97-14486A Heating Element DC32-00007A Samsung Thermistor DC47-00016A Thermal Fuse Dryer AP4342351 AP4201716 AP4201894 PS4204984 PS4205213 Part Repla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HtQkz4ecS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Dc97-14486a Samsung Dryer Heating Element Replacement - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP4342351, DC97-14486D, DC97-08891A, PS4220205. The Dc97-14486a Assembly generates heat when the dryer is running, which helps to dry and deodorize your clothes. DC97-14486A Dryer Heating Element Assembly comes fully assembled in a durable metal casing, making it simple to install and operate. Samsung Dc97-14486a Heating Element comes with two wires. 💡 DC47-00016A Dryer Thermal Fuse - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP4201894, 2068545, PS4205213. Dryer fuse assembly is compatible with Samsung, Kenmore appliances. Dc47-00016a Thermal Fuse Samsung Part is located on the dryer's blower housing and is a small, rectangular device with two wires attached to it. Disconnect dryer from the power source before the repair. Dc47-00016a Thermal Fuse fits hundreds of models and can be installed in a few minutes. 💡 DC32-00007A Dryer Thermistor - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP4201716, 2068429, PS4204984. It is attached to the blower housing. Dryer Thermistor is compatible with Samsung, Kenmore, Skuttle appliances. It is responsible for measuring the temperature and sending signals to the dryer's control board to adjust the heating elements accordingly. Our thermistors fit hundreds of models and can be installed in a few minutes. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. DC97-14486A & DC47-00016A & DC32-00007A Dryer Repair Kit will help if your appliance produces not enough heat, doesn't start, or shuts off too soon. Our Set meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Popular Models: 402.89032010, dv218aeb/xaa, dv218aew/xaa, dv219aew/xaa, dv220aew/xaa, dv231aew/xaa, dv2c6bew/xaa, dv306lew/xaa, dv317aeg, dv328aeg/xaa, dv328aer/xaa, dv328aew/xaa, dv330aeb/xaa, dv330aew/xaa, dv331aer/xaa, dv331aew/xaa, dv337aeg/xaa, dv337aer/xaa, dv338aeb/xaa, dv338aew/xaa, dv350aep/xaa, dv350aer/xaa, dv350aew/xaa, dv361ewbewr/a3, dv363ewbeuf/a1, dv365etbgwr/a3, dv393etpara/a1, dv393etpawr/a1, dv395etpara/a1, dv395etpasu/a1, dv395etpawr/a1, dv400ewhdwr/aa, dv405etpasu/aa.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HtQkz4ecS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B083LGZG1T","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-109471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083LGZG1T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B083LGZG1T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
