window.products.push({"id":109556,"name":"Kenmore Elite 27003 20.5 cu. ft. Upright Freezer in Stainless Steel, includes delivery and hookup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ADI0x323L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Store more frozen meat, fish, leftovers, and frozen foods with the extra-large Kenmore Elite 20.5 Cubic Feet Upright Freezer. This standing upright freezer is the perfect solution for storing frozen goods.This freestanding freezer comes with enough space to store over 711 lbs. of your favorite summer fruits for smoothies, vegetables for a quick dinner, or your bulk meats. At only 34 inches wide, this freezer only unit can fit in smaller spaces while still providing you ample room for all of your frozen goods. For the most efficient operation of the Kenmore Elite standing storage freezer, the unit should be located where surrounding temperatures will not exceed 110°F (43°C). Temperatures of 32°F (0°C) and below will not affect operation.Features Freeze Fresh Technology allowing the standing freezer to freeze foods at -20 degrees F, colder than other freezer brands. With this technology, your food keeps it quality and nutrients. You can also use the Express Chill function to quickly reduce the temperature to -30 degrees F for up to 72 hours. Plus, the convenient frost-free design means you'll never have to manually defrost this upright freezer. The freezer’s frost-free design uses an advanced technology to keep fresh air flowing throughout the extra-large freezer for an even temperature. Control panel on the front allows for easy adjustment of temperature.The interior storage space of the storage freezer is customizable. It contains adjustable shelves to accommodate larger items. The bottom door bin is great for storing items that require a soft freeze zone, like ice cream and frozen desserts. Keeps foods frozen, but not frozen solid. Kenmore recommends measuring your space to ensure the freezer will fit.DIMENSIONS: 30.53\" L x 34\" W x 73.19\" HSTORAGE SPACE: 20.5 cubic feet of interior storage spaceINCLUDES DELIVERY: Purchase includes room of choice delivery, unboxing, item hook-up (including required parts) and free optional haul-away at checkout.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ADI0x323L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kenmore","source_asin":"B074D2Y4Z6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-109556","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074D2Y4Z6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B074D2Y4Z6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
