window.products.push({"id":109682,"name":"TOREAD Portable Small Washing Machine, 13.5Lbs Mini Compact Washer and Spinner Combo, 2 in 1 Apartment Washers with Twin Tub and Drain Pump for Laundr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KMUVuObAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Twin Tub Portable Laundry Machine】This product designed with twin tub,allowing you to wash and spin clothes at the same time.Our compact washing with lightweight only 9 pounds,suitable for dorms, apartments, condos, RV’s, camping trips or anywhere with limited space! 【Easy operation】This washing machine total capacity: 13.5 lbs.Washer: 9 lbs, Spin Cycle: 4.5 lbs. It allows you to simply put clothes in the washing tub, fill with water, choose the timer control, then start washing.You can take the clothes directly from the washer to the spinner, or run both sides together to finish your laundry. Choose the water lever according to the quantity of the garments,high or low,for the water level of the double water stream,it’s the best position of the high. 【Separate time control】The twin tub washing machine equipped with two separate timer control.Wash timer runs for up to 15 minutes and the spin cycle timer runs for up to 5 minutes each load. You can operate the washer or spinner separately according to your different needs.3 different washing methods can meet for your washing needs conveniently,gently,normal wash and spin. 【Convenient and water saving】This machine can help you save more water,because of the pre-program settings and accurate time control. Durable ABS material ensures this portable washer and dryer will not easy be rust, neat, and clean. The light blue lid design, allows you to see and monitor washing conditions clearly. 【Specifications & Warm Note 】Designed of High-density plastic body + Aluminum pump +Stainless steel spin tub+ Upgraded motor , make it well built to use for several years.What’s more,warm note for you, press well the water cover on the garments strike the machine while drying.Never drying while drain,should finish drain and move the garments into the drying tube to avoid damage the machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KMUVuObAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOREAD","source_asin":"B0B9BFXVR3","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-109682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9BFXVR3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9BFXVR3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
