window.products.push({"id":109708,"name":"Reusable K Cups for Keurig 2.0 & 1.0 Brewers Universal Refillable Single Cup Coffee Filters Coffee Pods, Coffee Scoop, Stainless Steel Mesh Filter (6 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GSfHS0rKL._AC_SL1177_.jpg","description":"Product description Why Choose DOUBLE 2 C K Cups Reusable Coffee Filter ? Enjoying Better Coffee:DOUBLE 2 C reusable coffee pods for Keurig can help you brewer a fresh and delicious coffee, as you like. Perhaps pre-fill coffee k-cups were storage for long time and resulting in a coffee which is bad tasty than a fresh coffee. I think DOUBLE 2 C refillable k cups are the best choice to enjoy better coffee.  Save Your Cost and Save Energy:To instead of the pre-filled coffee k cups, using reusable k cups filters can help you save your wallet from buying regular k cups, meanwhile you can get more delicious coffee. Reduce Carbon and Protect Our Earth:Instead of pre-filled coffee k cups, k cups reusable coffee filter can help you reducing carbon to the Earth, we can protect our Earth when you are enjoying. Features: Diffusion Cone:Ensures that your grounds or tea stays inside of the K cups, preventing messes. Rubber Gasket:Designed to perfectly distribute hot water evenly through your steeping material for maximum flavor extraction. BPA Free Plastic:No unhealthy chemical runoff or strange flavor additions! Just pure, untainted beverage. Screen Mesh On Bottom:For 100% steepage. Results in a stronger brew and fully-used grounds. Product Detail: Material: 304 Stainless Steel Mesh& BPA Free Plastic  Color: Black Package Include: 6 x Reusable K Cups Filters 1 x Coffee Scoop How to use: Put coffee powder into the K cups,then close the lid.  Insert the K cups into coffee machine.  Close the cover of the coffee machine and start operating it.  Waiting for coffee to flow out,coffee brewing completed. Notes: Please clean immediately after use and keep it clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GSfHS0rKL._AC_SL1177_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOUBLE 2 C","source_asin":"B08JBYHQZC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-109708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JBYHQZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JBYHQZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
