window.products.push({"id":109800,"name":"SEISSO 4 Pack Anti Vibration Pads Anti-walk Washer and Dryer Rubber Pads for Noise Dampening Shock Absorbing Prevent Washer Dryer Noise Moving Shaking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C2j1jEmUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅DOUBLE-LAYER DESIGN: The upper layer is made of high-quality PP material, the lower layer is made of hard rubber, with good shock absorption, durable, and high-performance. Durable PP furniture risers can hold up to 1300 pounds of furniture. Note: Applicable to the feet of furniture or washer/dryer within 1.85 inches in diameter, compatible with most washer and dryer brands and models. ✅MODULAR DESIGN: You can add layers of modules to increase height as needed. Add height to your appliances to protect them from moisture while making cleaning easier. If you use a washing machine and dryer, you may need 2 sets of anti-vibration and anti-slip pads to make them the same height. ✅NOISE & MOVEMENT REDUCTION: The heavy-duty furniture risers can effectively reduce the noise caused by the washing machine during operation, and the anti-walking design of the footpads can prevent the washing machine from walking. ✅PREVENT FLOOR SCRATCHES: The rubber foot pad can prevent the washer or dryer from damaging the ground. Is a simple solution to protect your floor from scratches, protect appliances from damage, save you time and money. ✅EASY TO INSTALL- No need for adhesives. No tools and operating skills are required, just slide the footpads under the washing machine to install it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C2j1jEmUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEISSO","source_asin":"B08LVMS4JZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-109800","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LVMS4JZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LVMS4JZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":109801,"name":"CAVALIERE 36\" Inch Glass Canopy Island Mounted Stainless Steel Kitchen Range Hood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51p08l82ztL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"900 CFM: More powerful then most competitors, this exhaust system is made for heavy duty cooking that removes grease, odors and potentially toxic pollutants from the air in your kitchen Designed with a Whisper quiet single chamber centrifugal blower. The noise level is at 25 decibels on the lowest setting and 56 decibels on the highest speed setting. Built to Last: Commercial grade heavy duty 19 gauge stainless steel construction is non-magnetic and rust proof with a brushed finish. 6\" inch round ducting comes from the top of the range hood and a adjustable chimney accommodates a 8' ft to 9' ft ceiling. If your ceiling height is above 9' ft, then a higher chimney extension is required. ( Sold Separately) Easy to Use: 6 speed levels are controlled by a touch sensitive electronic control panel that allows for simple operational use of the range hood. Four Dimmable LED light bulbs placed in the front of the range hood provide enough illumination for your entire cooktop surface. Filtration System: Stainless steel baffle filters are more durable, dishwasher safe and easier to clean allowing for cost effective low maintenance. USA based customer support team.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51p08l82ztL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAVALIERE","source_asin":"B00115WAL0","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-109801","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00115WAL0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00115WAL0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
